### 2. Login Attempt Before Email Verification (Security Test)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saeed@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

/*
===================================================================
EXPECTED HTTP RESPONSE (401 Unauthorized):
===================================================================
{
  "statusCode": 401,
  "message": "Please verify your email address first.",
  "error": "Unauthorized"
}

===================================================================
BEHAVIOR NOTE:
===================================================================
The authentication attempt must fail because the user status is still
'pending_verification' and 'emailVerified' is false in CouchDB.
No session document or JWT tokens are issued at this stage.
*/